    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [X] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.sessions\n\n### Question\n\nHello, I'm using mini.sessions + nvim-ufo.\r\n\r\nI've a question - is it possible to configure `mini.sessions` so it will persist folds?\r\n\r\nI tried adding `vim.opt.sessionoptions:append('folds')` but this has no effect.\r\n",
    "bodyHTML": "<h3 dir=\"auto\">Contributing guidelines</h3>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> I have read <a href=\"https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md\">CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Module(s)</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">mini.sessions</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Question</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Hello, I'm using mini.sessions + nvim-ufo.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I've a question - is it possible to configure <code class=\"notranslate\">mini.sessions</code> so it will persist folds?</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I tried adding <code class=\"notranslate\">vim.opt.sessionoptions:append('folds')</code> but this has no effect.</p>",
    "bodyText": "Contributing guidelines\n\n I have read CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md\n\nModule(s)\nmini.sessions\nQuestion\nHello, I'm using mini.sessions + nvim-ufo.\nI've a question - is it possible to configure mini.sessions so it will persist folds?\nI tried adding vim.opt.sessionoptions:append('folds') but this has no effect.",
    "category": {
